Set up the working directory first in all the commands of the CLI (from ``workdir`` in the YAML) and in :func:`.run`, :func:`.collect`, :func:`.queue`, :func:`.reset` and :func:`.list_elements`, adding the ``workdir`` parameter to :func:`.collect` and :func:`.list_elements`, and create the working directory if it does not exist by `Synchon Mandal`_ and `Fede Raimondo`_
